        </p>


        <!-- =================================================
             16. CHANGES TO TERMS
             ================================================= -->

        <h2>16. Changes to These Terms</h2>

        <p>
            We may update these Terms & Conditions from time to time
            to reflect changes to the Website, services, technology,
